{"id":"be8269f43f53475f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTFreeRow.md","title":"FTFreeRow","display":"FTFreeRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FTFreeRow","parameters":["F","f","z1254","z1255","z1256"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FTFreeRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>f</span><span>z1254</span><span>z1255</span><span>z1256</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶语法与替换。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>z1254</code>、<code>z1255</code>、<code>z1256</code>。</p>\n<p>某变量在一阶项中出现。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FTFreeRow F f z1254 z1255 z1256)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists x\n  (exists t\n    (and\n      (@ Pair x t z1256)\n      (and\n        (@ Nat x)\n        (and\n          (@ FTerm F f t)\n          (or\n            (@ FVar x t)\n            (exists z1259\n              (exists z1260\n                (exists z1261\n                  (exists z1262\n                    (exists z1263\n                      (and\n                        (@ FFun z1259 z1260 t)\n                        (and\n                          (@ Seq z1260 z1261)\n                          (and\n                            (in z1262 z1261)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1260 z1262 z1263)\n                            (exists z1264\n                            (exists z1265 (and (in z1264 z1255) (and (@ App z1254 z1264 z1265) (@ Pair x z1263 z1265))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140c6359fed2eb8a\" href=\"?note=140c6359fed2eb8a\" title=\"ZFC_FFun\">FFun</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"21487f65c94a2183\" href=\"?note=21487f65c94a2183\" title=\"ZFC_FTerm\">FTerm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e67edc6c28bf5962\" href=\"?note=e67edc6c28bf5962\" title=\"ZFC_FVar\">FVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FTFreeRow F f z1254 z1255 z1256)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FFun|FFun]]；[[ZFC_FTerm|FTerm]]；[[ZFC_FVar|FVar]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FFun","status":"resolved","id":"140c6359fed2eb8a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依